      "created_at": "2013-04-04T05:38:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>He, from the flavor text I got, is the Sheriff who replaced Jim, Chrono-Ranger, after Jim got sent through time. They do know each other, and Jim has that stroy about the old guy bashing someone's hands in the cell door, so I'd say he was the sheriff,was good enough to retire and left the job to Jim, then took over when Jim disappeared.</p><p>Also, he's standing behind the heroes, the guns seem to all be from the gang members</p>",
